Package: maxRgain
Title: Maximizing the genetic gains of the Polyclonal selection based on integer programming
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sónia", family = "Surgy", email = "soniasurgy@isa.ulisboa.pt", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = "Elsa", family = "Gonçalves", email = "elsagoncalves@isa.ulisboa.pt", role = c("aut")),
    person(given = "Jorge", family = "Cadima", email = "jcadima@isa.ulisboa.pt", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Implements an Integer Programming-based method for optimising genetic gain in polyclonal selection, where the goal is to select a group of genotypes that jointly meet multi-trait selection criteria. The method uses genetic effect predictors from mixed models and is demonstrated with grapevine data, but is applicable to other species and breeding contexts.
